{"parse": {"title": "Traits", "pageid": 165, "revid": 46993, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 300px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/7a/Traits.png/revision/latest?cb=20231108203045\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Traits\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/7a/Traits.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20231108203045\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"144\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Traits.png\" data-image-key=\"Traits.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Traits.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Traits</b> are modifiers that boost unit’s stats (<b>Damage</b>, <b>SPA</b> &amp; <b>Range</b>). When you summon a unit or obtain it from a portal, it might come with a trait. Additionally, you can reroll traits through the use of<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101183057\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"StarRemnant\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250101183057\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-image-key=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><b>Star Remnants</b> or <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><b> Reroll Tokens</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rerolling_Traits\">Rerolling Traits</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 300px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4e/Traits2.png/revision/latest?cb=20231108203607\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Traits2\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Traits2.png\" data-image-key=\"Traits2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4e/Traits2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20231108203607\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4e/Traits2.png/revision/latest?cb=20231108203607\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Traits2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4e/Traits2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20231108203607\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Traits2.png\" data-image-key=\"Traits2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/4e/Traits2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20231108203607\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Traits2.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>To reroll traits, interact with <b>Ethereal Guide</b>, who is outside the <b>Evolve</b> area in the lobby (can be teleported to by using <b>Traits and Evolve</b> shortcut). Currently, there are two ways to reroll a trait: using<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101183057\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"StarRemnant\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-image-key=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250101183057\" /></a></span><b>Star Remnants</b> or <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" /></a></span><b>Reroll Tokens</b>.  \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101183057\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"StarRemnant\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-image-key=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250101183057\" /></a></span><b>Star Remnants</b> can be obtained from the <a href=\"/wiki/Travelling_Merchant_Shop\" title=\"Travelling Merchant Shop\">Travelling Merchant Shop</a>, by completing <a href=\"/wiki/Challenges\" title=\"Challenges\">Daily Challenges</a>, from removing <b>Shinies</b> (by interacting with <b>Lucil</b> in the lobby), by defeating a <b>Star Golem</b> in latest <a href=\"/wiki/Infinite\" title=\"Infinite\">Infinite Mode</a>, or a 0.25% chance from summons. If the player is using<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101183057\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"StarRemnant\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-image-key=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250101183057\" /></a></span><b>Star Remnants</b> to reroll a trait, the amount required depends on the unit the trait is being rerolled on:  \n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> and <span class=\"C(Secret) game-font-face\">Secret</span> units require 5<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101183057\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"StarRemnant\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-image-key=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250101183057\" /></a></span><b>Star Remnants</b> per reroll,</li>\n<li><span class=\"C(Rare) game-font-face\">Rare</span>, <span class=\"C(Epic) game-font-face\">Epic</span> and <span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> units require 1<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest?cb=20250101183057\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"StarRemnant\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-image-key=\"StarRemnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/60/StarRemnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250101183057\" /></a></span><b>Star Remnant</b> per reroll.</li></ul>\n<hr /><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" /></a></span><b>Reroll Tokens</b> can be obtained from <a href=\"/wiki/Battlepass\" title=\"Battlepass\">Battlepasses</a>, Evolution Quests or other events. Any unit will require only 1<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" /></a></span><b>Reroll Token</b> per roll.<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" /></a></span><b>Reroll Tokens</b> can be also bought: \n</p><ul><li>1<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" /></a></span><b>Reroll Token</b> for 129 R$ ($1.62 USD)</li>\n<li>10<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" /></a></span><b>Reroll Tokens</b> for 999 R$ ($12.49 USD)</li>\n<li>50<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20230209202447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Reroll Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Reroll Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Reroll_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/1e/Reroll_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20230209202447\" /></a></span><b>Reroll Tokens</b> for 4500 R$ ($56.25 USD)</li></ul>\n<ul><li>List of Traits</li></ul>\n<table class=\"article-table\" style=\"border: 1px solid #302D40; border-radius:2em; overflow:hidden; display:block; box-shadow: 5px 5px 15px #a3f7e8; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; width: 650px;&gt;\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: center; font-family: rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;width: 120px;\">Trait\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center; font-family: rubik,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;\">Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/bf/Trait_Superior.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831131930\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Superior\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Superior.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Superior.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/bf/Trait_Superior.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831131930\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nSuperior</font><br />29.97%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait do increased <b>Damage</b> to enemies.\n<ul><li>Superior I increases <b>Damage</b> by 10%</li>\n<li>Superior II increases <b>Damage</b> by 12.5%</li>\n<li>Superior III increases <b>Damage</b> by 15%.</li></ul>\n<p>Superior I/II/III increases average <b>DPS</b> by 10/12.5/15% respectively. \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/35/Trait_Nimble.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831131940\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Nimble\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Nimble.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Nimble.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/35/Trait_Nimble.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831131940\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nNimble</font><br />24.98%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait have their <b>SPA</b> decreased, which allows them to attack more frequently.\n<ul><li>Nimble I decreases <b>SPA</b> by 5%</li>\n<li>Nimble II decreases <b>SPA</b> by 7.5%,</li>\n<li>Nimble III decreases <b>SPA</b> by 12%.</li></ul>\n<p>Nimble I/II/III increases average <b>DPS</b> by 5.2/8.1/13.6% respectively.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/ad/Trait_Range.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831131934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Range\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Range.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Range.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/ad/Trait_Range.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831131934\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nRange</font><br />24.98%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait have increased <b>Range</b>, which allows their attacks to reach more enemies.\n<ul><li>Range I increases <b>Range</b> by 10%</li>\n<li>Range II increases <b>Range</b> by 12.5%,</li>\n<li>Range III increases <b>Range</b> by 15%.</li></ul>\n<p>Range I/II/III does not increase average <b>DPS</b> if the unit can always reach enemies.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f6/Trait_Adept.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133847\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Adept\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Adept.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Adept.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f6/Trait_Adept.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831133847\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nAdept</font><br />9.99%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this Trait level up at a faster rate, receiving 50% more XP. This trait is good for leveling up low-level units.\n<p><br />\nAdept does not increase <b>DPS</b>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/21/Trait_Culling.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133851\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Culling\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Culling.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Culling.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/21/Trait_Culling.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831133851\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nCulling</font><br />5%</center> \n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait have a 20% <b>Damage</b> boost to enemies with 30% or lower health.\n<p><br />\nCulling increases average <b>DPS</b> for units by 20% to enemies with under 30% health or lower, averaging to 6% increase.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fb/Trait_Sniper.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Sniper\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Sniper.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Sniper.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fb/Trait_Sniper.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831133900\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nSniper</font><br />2.5%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait receive a 25% <b>Range</b> boost.\n<p><br />\nThis trait is ideal for units like <a href=\"/wiki/Operator_(ROOM)\" title=\"Operator (ROOM)\">Operator (ROOM)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowgirl_(Time_Traveller)\" title=\"Shadowgirl (Time Traveller)\">Shadowgirl (Time Traveller)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\">Commander</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wind_Dragon\" title=\"Wind Dragon\">Wind Dragon</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Elfy_(Sylph)\" title=\"Elfy (Sylph)\">Elfy (Sylph)</a>, since their ability can affect more enemies, units, or have a stronger impact.\n</p><p>Sniper does not increase average <b>DPS</b> if the unit can always reach enemies.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/2b/Trait_Godspeed.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133856\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Godspeed\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Godspeed.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Godspeed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/2b/Trait_Godspeed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831133856\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nGodspeed </font><br />1%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait receive a 20% SPA reduction, significantly increasing attack frequency.\n<p><br />\nIdeal for slow units such as <a href=\"/wiki/Gene_(%3F%3F%3F)\" title=\"Gene (???)\">Gene (???)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mimic_Sorcerer_(Cursed_Child)\" title=\"Mimic Sorcerer (Cursed Child)\">Mimic Sorcerer (Cursed Child)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jackal_(Alpha)\" title=\"Jackal (Alpha)\">Jackal (Alpha)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Illusionist_(Final)\" title=\"Illusionist (Final)\">Illusionist (Final)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hammer_Giantess_(Creation)\" title=\"Hammer Giantess (Creation)\">Hammer Giantess (Creation)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Queen_(Empire%27s_Strongest)\" title=\"Ice Queen (Empire&#39;s Strongest)\">Ice Queen (Empire's Strongest)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Millie_(Holy)\" title=\"Millie (Holy)\">Millie (Holy)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Golden_Tyrant_(Emperor)\" title=\"Golden Tyrant (Emperor)\">Golden Tyrant (Emperor)</a> ,<a href=\"/wiki/Frost_Navy_(Blue_Pigeon)\" title=\"Frost Navy (Blue Pigeon)\">Frost Navy (Blue Pigeon)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Reliable_Student_(Echoes)\" title=\"Reliable Student (Echoes)\">Reliable Student (Echoes)</a>.\n</p><p>This trait gives your unit a blue lightning aura.\n</p><p>Godspeed increases average DPS by 25%.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d9/Trait_Reaper.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133708\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Reaper\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Reaper.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Reaper.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d9/Trait_Reaper.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831133708\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nReaper</font><br />0.8%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait do 15% more <b>Damage</b> and deal 25% more <b>Damage</b> to bosses.\n<p><br />\nGood trait for units that work well against bosses like <a href=\"/wiki/Captain_(God)\" title=\"Captain (God)\">Captain (God)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Curse_(Contract)\" title=\"Curse (Contract)\">Curse (Contract)</a>.\n</p><p><i>This trait gives your unit a red and blackish aura.</i>\n</p><p>Reaper increases average <b>DPS</b> by 15% normally, and by 43.75% when damaging a boss.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f9/Trait_Celestial.png/revision/latest?cb=20221225203625\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Celestial\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Celestial.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Celestial.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f9/Trait_Celestial.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20221225203625\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nCelestial</font><br />0.36%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait have a 10% <b>Damage</b> boost, a 10% <b>Range</b> boost and a 20% <b>Damage Buff</b> as <b>True Damage</b> (With 100% buff from Leafy/Wenda/Orwin the bonus is reduced to 10% <b>Damage Buff</b> as <b>True Damage</b>, but 200% buff with <b>Griffin (Reincarnation)</b> included, it is reduced to 13.3% <b>Damage Buff</b> as <b>True Damage</b>, with just griff the true damage buff is still 20% since griff buffs all dmg types.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n<p>Units that inflict DoT (Damage Over Time, e.g. Bleed)  with trait does 20% more DoT damage, due to its base DoT dmg already scaling from the combined sum of its total dmg (Dmg + True dmg), and also adding an extra 20% true damage from celestial\n</p><p><br />\nGood for <a href=\"/wiki/Infinity_Mansion\" title=\"Infinity Mansion\">Infinity Mansion</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Legend_Stages\" title=\"Legend Stages\">Legend Stages</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Challenges\" title=\"Challenges\">Daily Challenges</a> or any mode that has enemies with resistances.\n</p><p><i>This trait gives your unit a purple galaxy aura.</i>\n</p><p>Celestial increases average <b>DPS</b> by 32%\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/14/Trait_Divine.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133702\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Divine\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Divine.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Divine.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/14/Trait_Divine.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831133702\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nDivine</font><br />0.2%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait have a 20% <b>Damage</b> boost, 10% <b>SPA</b> reduction, and a 20% <b>Range</b> boost.\n<p><br />\nIdeal trait for: \n</p>\n<ul><li>Units with 4+ spawn cap, like <a href=\"/wiki/Joykid_(Mode_IV)\" title=\"Joykid (Mode IV)\">Joykid (Mode IV)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gamer_(Dual)\" title=\"Gamer (Dual)\">Gamer (Dual)</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Hammerhead_(Shark_Empress)\" title=\"Hammerhead (Shark Empress)\">Hammerhead (Shark Empress)</a>;</li>\n<li>Support units that benefit from multiple placements, like <a href=\"/wiki/Shinobi_(Eternal)\" title=\"Shinobi (Eternal)\">Shinobi (Eternal)</a>;</li>\n<li>Units that need multiple placements for the best effect, like <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Ascension)\" title=\"Griffin (Ascension)\">Griffin (Ascension)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n<i>This trait gives your unit angelic wings.</i>\n</p><p>Divine increases average <b>DPS</b> by 33.3%.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Trait_Golden.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133640\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Golden\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Golden.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Golden.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Trait_Golden.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20220831133640\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nGolden</font><br />0.15%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this trait have a 30% <b>Damage</b> boost and receive 20% more <b>Yen</b> each time they make money.\n<p><br />\nIdeal trait for farm units <a href=\"/wiki/Bulby\" title=\"Bulby\">Bulby</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/C.E.O.\" title=\"C.E.O.\">C.E.O.</a>. Note that while <a href=\"/wiki/Weather_Girl_(Thief)\" title=\"Weather Girl (Thief)\">Weather Girl (Thief)</a> being a farm unit, Golden only gives her a 30% <b>Damage</b> boost, but not a <b>Yen</b> boost. \n</p><p><i>This trait gives your unit a golden appearance.</i>\n</p><p>Golden increases average <b>DPS</b> by 30%.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/5c/Trait_Unique.png/revision/latest?cb=20250121232957\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Unique\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Unique.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Unique.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/5c/Trait_Unique.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20250121232957\" /></a></span><br /> <font size=\"5\">\nUnique</font><br />0.1%</center>\n</td>\n<td>Units with this Trait have a 4x (300%) <b>Damage</b> boost, 10% <b>SPA</b> reduction, and a 10% <b>Range</b> boost. Units with this trait are restricted to a maximum of <b>ONE</b> of this unit placed (only affects the owner of the unit).\n<p><br />\nIdeal trait for units with 3 placements, like <a href=\"/wiki/Illusionist_(Final)\" title=\"Illusionist (Final)\">Illusionist (Final)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Priest_(Heaven)\" title=\"Priest (Heaven)\">Priest (Heaven)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hubris_(The_One)\" title=\"Hubris (The One)\">Hubris (The One)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Berserker_(Rage)\" title=\"Berserker (Rage)\">Berserker (Rage)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tango_(Flash_God)\" title=\"Tango (Flash God)\">Tango (Flash God)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Stringy_(Awakened)\" title=\"Stringy (Awakened)\">Stringy (Awakened)</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_God_(Tyrant_of_the_Seas)\" title=\"Sea God (Tyrant of the Seas)\">Sea God (Tyrant of the Seas)</a>.\n</p><p>Perfect trait for units with high individual <b>DPS</b> but low (1 - 2) placement cap, like <a href=\"/wiki/JIO_(Over_Heaven)\" title=\"JIO (Over Heaven)\">JIO (Over Heaven)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Knight_(Arsenal)\" title=\"Iron Knight (Arsenal)\">Iron Knight (Arsenal)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Usurper_(Founder)\" title=\"Usurper (Founder)\">Usurper (Founder)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Time_Wizard_(Chronos)\" title=\"Time Wizard (Chronos)\">Time Wizard (Chronos)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_Knight_(King)\" title=\"Skeleton Knight (King)\">Skeleton Knight (King)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Illusionist_(Transcended)\" title=\"Illusionist (Transcended)\">Illusionist (Transcended)</a>  or <a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Being_(Sovereign)\" title=\"Supreme Being (Sovereign)\">Supreme Being (Sovereign)</a>. These units can even outperform their 3 placements counterparts.\n</p><p>Although units with 4+ placements have either a weak group <b>DPS</b> increase or even a <b>DPS</b> decrease, it can still be a useful trait for progressive gamemode due to being 4+ times cheaper to max.\n</p><p><i>This trait gives your unit an enchanting aura adorned with ancient runic symbols.</i>\n</p><p>Unique increases average <b>DPS</b> by 344.4% for a single unit. Group average <b>DPS</b> increase depends on unit's placement cap.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\" style=\"border: none;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Spawn Cap\n</th>\n<th>Group <b>DPS</b> increase\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>344.4%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>122.2%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>48.1%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>11.1%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td>-11%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td>-25.9%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When evolving a <span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> unit to <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span>, its trait will be transfered. Therefore, rolling a trait on its <span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> form will be 5 times cheaper.\n<ul><li>Units that can benefit from this are <a href=\"/wiki/Fox_Ninja_(Beast_Cloak)\" title=\"Fox Ninja (Beast Cloak)\">Fox Ninja (Beast Cloak)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Usurper\" title=\"Usurper\">Usurper</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Demon\" title=\"Martial Demon\">Martial Demon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gene\" title=\"Gene\">Gene</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Experiment_X_(Semi-Perfect)\" title=\"Experiment X (Semi-Perfect)\">Experiment X (Semi-Perfect)</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Although Superior, Nimble and Range are <span class=\"C(Rare) game-font-face\">Rare</span> traits, their third variant (III) has an <span class=\"C(Epic) game-font-face\">Epic</span> rarity, indicated by a purple trait symbol and label.</li>\n<li>There is a <b>0.2%</b> chance that you can receive <b>double trait</b> on one unit while rerolling traits.\n<ul><li>When this happens, total percentage boost of two traits will be added.\n<ul><li>Double Superior III would give a 30% <b>Damage</b> boost.</li>\n<li>Double Unique would give a 600% <b>Damage</b> boost, 20% <b>SPA</b> reduction, and a 20% <b>Range</b> boost.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Newly obtained units have a <b>1%</b> chance to gain a trait. If successful, there is a <b>further 1% chance</b> to gain <b>double traits</b>.</li>\n<li>Unique can make some units as good or better than some <b>Meta</b> units.</li>\n<li>Culling, despite being a <span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> trait, has a very weak effect, barely outperforming Superior I (on average).</li>\n<li>In most circumstances, Reaper is equivalent to Superior III.</li>\n<li>While <b>Range</b> boosts do not affect unit's <b>Damage</b> or <b>SPA</b>, with the right placement units with traits that boost <b>Range</b> might have more opportunity for attacking, thus increasing average <b>DPS</b>.</li>\n<li>Golden is the only trait that effects farm units such as <a href=\"/wiki/C.E.O.\" title=\"C.E.O.\">C.E.O.</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Bulby\" title=\"Bulby\">Bulby</a>, giving 20% more gold each wave.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:CelestialComparison.png\" title=\"File:CelestialComparison.png\">Celestial with buffer comparison</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022191531\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 247/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1644/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 70/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 155/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.368      1 -total\n 51.00%    2.228     11 Template:Rarity\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:165-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261022191531 and revision id 46993. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": ["Traits.png", "StarRemnant.png", "Reroll_Token.png", "Traits2.png", "Trait_Superior.png", "Trait_Nimble.png", "Trait_Range.png", "Trait_Adept.png", "Trait_Culling.png", "Trait_Sniper.png", "Trait_Godspeed.png", "Trait_Reaper.png", "Trait_Celestial.png", "Trait_Divine.png", "Trait_Golden.png", "Trait_Unique.png"], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Rerolling Traits", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Traits", "byteoffset": 383, "anchor": "Rerolling_Traits", "linkAnchor": "Rerolling_Traits"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Trivia", "number": "2", "index": "2", "fromtitle": "Traits", "byteoffset": 9433, "anchor": "Trivia", "linkAnchor": "Trivia"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Traits</span>"}}